{"title":"深圳：印发住宅建筑新规！四大调整！","date":"2024-05-24","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.5pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">深圳：印发住宅建筑新规！四大调整！</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nmso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone\">5</span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nArial;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">17</span>日，深圳市自然资源和规划局印发《深圳市建筑设计规则》。有四大调整：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">1</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">、 阳台更灵活，进深不再限制<span lang=\"EN-US\">2.4m</span></span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"border: 1pt solid rgb(227, 227, 227); padding: 0cm; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border: none; padding: 0cm;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">过去对阳台面宽有比较严格的规定：阳台面宽不大于<span lang=\"EN-US\">1.5m</span>时，其对外连续开敞面的边长不小于阳台计建筑面积线周长的<span lang=\"EN-US\">1/6</span>；阳台面宽大于<span lang=\"EN-US\">1.5m</span>时，其对外连续开敞面的边长不小于阳台计建筑面积线周长的<span lang=\"EN-US\">1/4</span>。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border: none; padding: 0cm;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">在新的规定中，增加了<b><span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>计一半面积的阳台进深不超过<span lang=\"EN-US\">2.4m</span>，超过部分的水平投影面积应全部计入规定建筑面积<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>；<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>阳台总投影面积<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ge;26</span>㎡时，取<span lang=\"EN-US\">60</span>㎡与除阳台外套内建筑面积<span lang=\"EN-US\">x20%</span>中的较小值。<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span></b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border: none; padding: 0cm;\">\r\n\t\t<b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">以往的规则中，阳台的进深限制为不超过<span lang=\"EN-US\">2.4</span>米，即超过<span lang=\"EN-US\">2.4</span>米将不再作为阳台享受一半面积计算。新规则的变更允许了阳台进深的增加，这为设计提供了更大的灵活性。然而，这也意味着任何超过<span lang=\"EN-US\">2.4</span>米的部分将会影响总建筑面积的计算。</span></b><span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋; font-size: 15pt; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; text-indent: 31.6pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\t<div style=\"border: 1pt solid rgb(227, 227, 227); padding: 0cm; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border: none; padding: 0cm;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">这次规定的修订在提供设计上的灵活性的同时，也增加了对超出常规尺寸部分的约束，确保建筑设计既符合实用需求，也遵守城市规划的整体要求。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\t</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">2</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">、凸窗更大<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>进深<span lang=\"EN-US\">0.6m</span>提升到<span lang=\"EN-US\">0.8m</span></span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"border: 1pt solid rgb(227, 227, 227); padding: 0cm; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border: none; padding: 0cm;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">在最新的建筑设计规则中，<b>凸窗的进深由原先的<span lang=\"EN-US\">0.6</span>米增加到了<span lang=\"EN-US\">0.8</span>米，这意味着凸窗的面积将显著增大。</b>这项改变将为建筑内部提供更多的自然光照和更宽敞的视野，从而改善居住或工作空间的质量和舒适度。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">3</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">、公摊范围减小，部分公共空间不计容</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">得房率，是衡量住宅建筑中私有部分面积占建筑总面积的比例。增加得房率意味着业主在购买住房时，将获得更多实际可用的居住空间，相对减少了不计入个人产权的公摊面积。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">修订规则中提到，<b>未来如避难层、机房等公共建设空间将<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>不计容面积<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>，这些空间不会体现在房产证上的建筑面积之中。</b>这一调整直接影响了公摊面积的计算，从而使得房率得以提升。高层住宅为例，同样产证<span lang=\"EN-US\">100</span>㎡的房子，套内面积可能会由<span lang=\"EN-US\">85</span>㎡提升到<span lang=\"EN-US\">87</span>㎡（仅作参考）。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">公摊面积通常包括两大部分：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 18pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">公共服务空间：这部分包括电梯井、管道井、楼梯间、垃圾道、变电室、设备间、公共门厅、过道、地下室及值班警卫室等。这些空间是为整幢楼提供服务的，不属于任何个别业主。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 18pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">结构空间：包括楼宇（套）与公共空间之间的分隔以及外墙（包括山墙）墙体的水平投影面积的<span lang=\"EN-US\">50%</span>。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">通过不将某些公共建设区域计入建筑面积，可以有效减少公摊面积，进而提高每个住户实际拥有的居住面积比例。<b>这种变化可以增加住房的市场价值，使得投资者和最终用户都能从中获益。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">4</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">、建筑高度或许能突破<span lang=\"EN-US\">150m</span></span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">住宅和宿舍的建筑高度不宜大于<span lang=\"EN-US\">150m</span>。意味可以突破<span lang=\"EN-US\">150m</span>。</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">新型产业用地（<span lang=\"EN-US\">M0</span>）中主导用途的建筑高度不得超过<span lang=\"EN-US\">250m</span>；其他配套建筑高度按照各自规模及相关规范合理确定。厂房的建筑高度从之前的不得大于<span lang=\"EN-US\">100</span>米，同一宗地内厂房之间的建筑高度比 （单层厂房除外）不得大于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2.5</span>。调整为建筑高度不宜大于<span lang=\"EN-US\">70m</span>。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>"}